# Daily sprint

When the user runs the sprint, asks for standup/daily scrum, or wants today’s meeting script, follow `.cursor/skills/daily-sprint/SKILL.md`.

1. Read `docs/sprint-1-progress.md` first (current day and card status).
2. Build only that day’s Sprint Backlog tasks unless the user names another day.
3. Update `docs/sprint-1-progress.md` after the work.
4. Write `docs/sprint-1-scrum-meeting-{N}.md` from `docs/templates/daily-scrum-script.md`.
5. Three questions, board on screen, Definition of Done before Done. Do not mark Done without QA.
6. Commit/push those docs (and code) when the user wants GitHub updated.
